    "catalog:tags": "hot water cylinder, cylinder, hot water, heating, storage",
    "catalog:note": "Indirect hot water cylinder standing on the floor. Cold feed low and the coil flow and return on the front, hot draw-off on the top. The axis is offset to z -0.025 so the footprint, front stubs included, centres on the origin. The 15 mm stubs are drawn at the 0.01 minimum radius; stubs under radius 0.04 build as polygonal prisms at true size.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Cylinder 0.55 diameter x 1.50, generic practice size, not checked against a published source (unverified). Port sizes are UK domestic practice per the drafting standard §8 table, unverified. IfcTankTypeEnum STORAGE (IFC4.3 docs, buildingSMART IFC4.3.x-development)",
